10:35.830 --> 10:36.630
Aku?

10:37.150 --> 10:37.720
Ya.

10:45.870 --> 10:47.470
Bawalah pulang lukisan ini.

10:48.030 --> 10:49.240
Gantung di kepala ranjang,

10:49.240 --> 10:50.960
